Scrapling Data free preview samples
===================================

These CSV files are the official free preview rows published by Scrapling Data
at https://scraplingdata.xyz. Each file matches the public sample at:

    https://scraplingdata.xyz/datasets/<dataset_id>/sample.csv

You may copy and redistribute these preview rows for discovery, research, and
attribution, provided you keep a clear link back to https://scraplingdata.xyz
and to the matching dataset page. They are not the paid datasets, and this
permission does not grant the right to copy or resell paid rows.

All data is provided as-is, without warranties of accuracy, completeness, or
availability. Nothing here is financial, investment, or legal advice. Do your
own research.

The full datasets are sold by Scrapling Data and are paid in USDC via x402.
Failed paid calls are not charged. See https://scraplingdata.xyz/terms.

